SELECT 'claude-code-session_015kWmGuAq2fNuvzu4MrD7x3',
  'a drill probe that can only fail (a phrase that tool output contains, a table that vanished, an event logged only on work) measures the probe and not the control, and a ticket it files never closes. A probe that passes whether or not the alternate works is worse: it stamps a control as tested',
  'CHAOS-DRILL-CALIBRATION-1: ops-jobs-payload-redaction scans budget-promote user and system messages and every other origin whole, research-floor-rearm reads the hourly idea-to-publish heartbeat and no longer demands an expiring table, evolve-wip-recovery gets a liveness probe on merged_at, research-quality-gate is recorded as ALTERNATE-NOT-EXERCISABLE instead of getting a decorative probe',
  'ops_jobs: 70 rows, 67 origin budget-promote, 6 phrase matches all role tool and none in a user or system message (json_each), 251 user and 69 system messages scanned with zero hits, the 3 origin NULL rows clean. cloud_ops_events idea-to-publish 48 events in 48 hours, park-rearm-tick 13. code_tasks 17 merged by merged_at in 24 h. An independent reviewer reproduced a leak that the first version missed and found the quality-gate probe decorative. Offline suite migrations/chaos-drill-calibration.test.mjs replays the probes, the register view and the rollback',
  'migration merged, the 13:01Z drill re-runs the probes',
  'rows of control_alternate_probes (two edited with their old probe kept as disabled history rows, one added), two control_registry text updates, one filed issue, read by the 6-hourly drill only',
  'the Rollback header restores the two edited probes from the history rows, removes the added probe if it has not run and reverts the two register texts (decision_log stays: append-only)',
  'a drill that fails stays failing only on real missing evidence, and a control is stamped tested only by evidence',
  'the 13:01Z drill reads ok for ops-jobs-payload-redaction and research-floor-rearm, issues 100482 and 1000057 close themselves, 1000214 closes once controls_untested_without_probe reads 0',
  'none',
  'd1:qnfo-audit control_alternate_probes, control_registry, v_control_alternate_status, ops_jobs (counts, role-filtered json_each and digit-masked snippets only), ops_config, cloud_ops_events, code_tasks, quality_scores, sqlite_master (SELECT only), qnfo-ops/worker.js, qnfo-research-exec/worker.js, qnfo-cloud-ops/worker.js, offline node:sqlite suite'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM decision_log WHERE instr(action, 'CHAOS-DRILL-CALIBRATION-1:') = 1);
